-- smucclaw/l4-ide#1106: two sections each define a rule called `the duty`.
-- `l4 lts --contract` and `l4 explore --contract` both take the first in the
-- file (Alice paying within 10), and neither says that there was another.

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF Alice
DECLARE Act IS ONE OF pay, ship

§ `First`

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Act
DECIDE `the duty` IS
    PARTY Alice MUST pay WITHIN 10 LEST BREACH BY Alice BECAUSE "late pay"

§ `Second`

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Act
DECIDE `the duty` IS
    PARTY Alice MUST ship WITHIN 20 LEST BREACH BY Alice BECAUSE "late ship"

§§ `Deeper`

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Act
DECIDE `the nested duty` IS
    PARTY Alice MUST ship WITHIN 30 LEST BREACH BY Alice BECAUSE "late ship"
